  ],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "TxT360-Midas",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTxT360-MidAS: Mid-training Actual and Synthetic data\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nTxT360-Midas is a mid-training dataset designed to extend language model context length up to 512k tokens while injecting strong reasoning capabilities via synthetic data.\nTxT360-Midas was used to mid-train the K2-V2 LLM, yielding base model with strong long-context performance and reasoning abilities. Resulting model demonstrates strong performance on complex mathematical and logic puzzle tasks.\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/IFM/TxT360-Midas.",
  "alternateName": [
    "IFM/TxT360-Midas"
  ],
